MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Active Life","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","review_id":"XmPR-k2a-cSy7ZYjiFdBAQ","date":"2017-06-29T00:00:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9366316795349121,"text_excerpt":"This place is super fun! I had a blast bowling there for a company party. The lanes are well oiled for bowling. The bowling alley itself is very clean. The food is delicious! I loved the shrimp remoulade and chicken Alfredo pasta. The fried seafood is good too. I got to taste the fried fish. Delicious! The staff was very friendly and helpful. We had problems with our bowling lane. The staff tried to fix it, but no success. They quickly moved us to another lane. The music playing on their speakers was really good. We also got to line dance on their dance floor. Super fun! I can't wait to go again and see a live band play."},{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","review_id":"oI2-y1a7Dhd2sPSwcyoLoA","date":"2016-12-31T23:44:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9348735213279724,"text_excerpt":"Went to Rock 'n' Bowl last Thursday for zydeco night with a NOLA local and we had fun! Great, large venue where you can dance, bowl, play a couple of arcade games, or just sit and watch everything happening around you. This place attracts all ages, including older couples there to dance and young people bowling. There's definitely a crowd that comes out for zydeco nights, and we had so much fun watching all the dancers -- they are so good! If you want to bowl, arrive early, as all the lanes were busy by the time we arrived around 8:30pm. You can put your name down for a lane and they'll text you when one opens up, but by the time we got the text (around 10:15pm), we were getting ready to ..."},{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","review_id":"qRsTB0_Y6dd2MzjDCaztsw","date":"2007-02-28T15:02:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9313767552375793,"text_excerpt":"I've been here only a couple of time. But I tell you, there are sometimes some really good bands coming through this place. Plus bowling while you listen. And the foods pretty alright if I remember correctly. Nice place to have a bowling party. My grandmother goes zydeco dancing here on Thursday nights. She swears by this place. Hah."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","photo_id":"oP8yw5V1dBOWmFes4pe1bw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/oP8yw5V1dBOWmFes4pe1bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8730639219284058},{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","photo_id":"l18iWiPaPwpOKNRdZEuUng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/l18iWiPaPwpOKNRdZEuUng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466593027114868},{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","photo_id":"WUSZFE3WRwpBm4FUuxEW0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WUSZFE3WRwpBm4FUuxEW0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8319252729415894},{"business_id":"muIfqhkAmF-_AT7pHHUOSw","photo_id":"hntUit9wiCmn_BvljQCtDw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hntUit9wiCmn_BvljQCtDw.jpg","visual_